  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nIf a \"Power Patron\" or \"Elfnote\" monster(s)
    is Special Summoned to your field, while this card is in your Pendulum Zone (except
    during the Damage Step): You can destroy this card, and if you do, draw 2 cards,
    then discard 1 card. You can only use this effect of \"Junoldo the Shadespirit
    Power Patron\" once per turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \n(This card is always treated
    as an \"Elfnote\" card.)\r\nYou can banish the top 3 cards of your Deck, face-down;
    destroy this card, and if you do, Special Summon 1 \"Junora the Power Patron
    of Tuning\" from your Extra Deck (this is treated as a Synchro Summon). If this
    card is added to your Extra Deck face-up: You can add 1 \"Power Patron\" or \"Elfnote\"
    card from your face-up Extra Deck or GY to your hand, except \"Junoldo the Shadespirit
    Power Patron\". You can only use each effect of \"Junoldo the Shadespirit Power
    Patron\" once per turn."
